ex:HodDB a ex:Database ;
    rdfs:label "HodDB" ;
    ex:MultipleGraphsSupport "HodDB supports the storage of multiple graphs which can be queried separately" ;
    ex:RDFModelStorage "supports the storage of RDF models on a local filesystem, using BadgerDB" ;
    ex:ReasoningInference "supports some basic inference --- namely handling OWL inverse and transitive properties." ;
    ex:SHACLSupport "HodDB does not support SHACL" ;
    ex:SPARQLSupport "supports a subset of SPARQL 1.1, including property path queries and UNION (specifically not inserts). See the HodDB papers for a more precise list. HodDB also does not support the SPARQL API protocol, and instead requries use of a specific GRPC-based API" ;
    ex:ScalingAndPerformance "Due to the restricted query and update model, HodDB provides excellent SPARQL query performance on graphs up to a few hundred thousand nodes. HodDB currently does not support distributed storage" .

